  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TASFAM - Tanzania Sustainable Marine Fisheries &amp; Aquaculture Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Blue Economy and Fisheries (MBEF) and UNDP as the technical advisor are engaging in this project in the development of infrastructure on aquaculture under implementation of agreed outputs within TASFAM in Zanzibar. UNDP will support the Ministry in the effective implementation of the TASFAM project by focusing on strengthening the seaweed economy, including scaling up resilient seaweed production and value addition opportunities with local, regional and global public and private sector partners.</narrative>
  </description>
